{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55664","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十二 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿柳堤边春色多，数树重重袅翠萝。\n红白花枝争鬬发，晴阴天气半相和。\n中山谩醉千壶酒，易水徒悲一曲歌。\n尘世无凭唯道外，荣枯瞬息尽消磨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}